alse" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186477311} {:answer/id #uuid "88d68881-4ce5-5cc2-8b8b-c3129b170191" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186477312}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "88d68881-4ce5-5cc2-8b8b-c3129b170191" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186477312} :answer-field/id #uuid "058434be-b274-586d-9c20-7a526c76c9a3" :answer-field/key "The product $AC$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186477625}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "59f14d04-9b7d-5b14-8363-a42027c3b11c" :question/math-academy-id "q-42374" :question/problem "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -2 & 1 & 7 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 5 \\\\ -0 & 6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $A,B,$ and $C?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Notice that $A$ is a $4\\times 2$ matrix, $B$ is a $2\\times 4$ matrix, and $C$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nThere are $2$ columns in $A$ and $2$ rows in $B.$ Since the number of columns in $A$ equals the number of rows in $B,$ the matrices $A$ and $B$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{A}_{4\\times \\boxed{\\text{2}}}{\\times }_{✓}{B}_{\\boxed{\\text{2}}\\times 4}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $4$ columns in $B$ and $4$ rows in $A.$ Since the number of columns in $B$ equals the number of rows in $A,$ the matrices $B$ and $A$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{B}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{4}}}{\\times }_{✓}{A}_{\\boxed{\\text{4}}\\times 2}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $2$ columns in $A$ and $2$ rows in $C.$ Since the number of columns in $A$ equals the number of rows in $C,$ the matrices $A$ and $C$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{A}_{4\\times \\boxed{\\text{2}}}{\\times }_{✓}{C}_{\\boxed{\\text{2}}\\times 2}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nThe products $AB$, $BA$, and $AC$ are well defined."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265727 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100869 :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fb45ac63-db12-5103-a680-0aca60a50ae0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448368} {:answer/id #uuid "a12d2978-9d54-59d4-9961-6bdc86f3c49f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448369}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fb45ac63-db12-5103-a680-0aca60a50ae0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448368} :answer-field/id #uuid "a0935ce5-8cb9-5439-9df5-d68f6b26b1b4" :answer-field/key "The product $RS$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449224} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7fb2ec2a-0f20-512b-93a8-4b9f3c962c38" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448370} {:answer/id #uuid "022054e0-5021-5992-9a69-680cffbd01c9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448371}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7fb2ec2a-0f20-512b-93a8-4b9f3c962c38" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448370} :answer-field/id #uuid "c2774138-c2fc-5876-84c5-93da8a175e9f" :answer-field/key "The product $RP$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449225} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cb2b2b09-edcc-581e-920d-e47a8346fc6c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448372} {:answer/id #uuid "c8393209-b177-529e-b28b-4beba3d7980d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448373}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c8393209-b177-529e-b28b-4beba3d7980d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186448373} :answer-field/id #uuid "887210a3-979a-5046-a639-10af689a9ba1" :answer-field/key "The product $SP$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186449226}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "22b7c2e7-9621-5013-a411-a722a7ceea01" :question/math-academy-id "q-129437" :question/problem "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$P=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$R=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$S=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 3 & 4 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $P,R,$ and $S?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Notice that $P$ is a $5\\times 3$ matrix, $R$ is a $1\\times 3$ row vector, and $S$ is a $1\\times 5$ row vector. \n\nThere are $3$ columns in $R$ and $1$ row in $S.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $S,$ the matrices $R$ and $S$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{1\\times 3}{\\times }_{\\ne }{S}_{1\\times 5}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $3$ columns in $R$ and $5$ rows in $P.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $P,$ the matrices $R$ and $P$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{1\\times 3}{\\times }_{\\ne }{P}_{5\\times 3}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $5$ columns in $S$ and $5$ rows in $P.$ Since the number of columns in $S$ equals the number of rows in $P,$ the matrices $S$ and $P$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{S}_{1\\times \\boxed{\\text{5}}}{\\times }_{✓}{P}_{\\boxed{\\text{5}}\\times 3}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nThe product $SP$ is well defined. The products $RS$ and $RP$ are undefined."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186290369 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100869 :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4a93ef54-75a7-58b3-aefb-23905447fd8f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450250} {:answer/id #uuid "4b995925-934b-5fd2-877f-aa3cf84a5166" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450251}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4b995925-934b-5fd2-877f-aa3cf84a5166" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450251} :answer-field/id #uuid "399ae7fe-01e2-5382-b1a9-4e47af718b72" :answer-field/key "The product $XY$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451079} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "44ff3d40-849a-5db8-9cf6-5fac0ac794ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450252} {:answer/id #uuid "3ef26044-c1a2-592a-854e-9764c570b332" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450253}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "44ff3d40-849a-5db8-9cf6-5fac0ac794ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450252} :answer-field/id #uuid "e8966769-d214-5dda-9b5c-f23fef8c54ed" :answer-field/key "The product $YX$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451080} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0e376649-41c7-5d9c-81ec-516f8c48228b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450254} {:answer/id #uuid "e18e340e-63df-594f-ab82-c85ec74e7f75" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450255}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e18e340e-63df-594f-ab82-c85ec74e7f75" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450255} :answer-field/id #uuid "5b7bc0c6-04f7-5fcb-9611-2c846635a049" :answer-field/key "The product $YZ$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451081}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "7f63e1f3-652b-58b6-9207-73ea266277c9" :question/math-academy-id "q-22055" :question/problem "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$X=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Y=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Z=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $X,Y,$ and $Z?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Notice that $X$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix, $Y$ is a $2\\times 3$ matrix, and $Z$ is a $3\\times 3$ matrix.\n\nThere are $2$ columns in $X$ and $2$ rows in $Y.$ Since the number of columns in $X$ equals the number of rows in $Y,$ the matrices $X$ and $Y$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{X}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{2}}}{\\times }_{✓}{Y}_{\\boxed{\\text{2}}\\times 3}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $3$ columns in $Y$ and $2$ rows in $X.$ Since the number of columns in $Y$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $X,$ the matrices $Y$ and $X$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{Y}_{2\\times 3}{\\times }_{\\ne }{X}_{2\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $3$ columns in $Y$ and $3$ rows in $Z.$ Since the number of columns in $Y$ equals the number of rows in $Z,$ the matrices $Y$ and $Z$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{Y}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{3}}}{\\times }_{✓}{Z}_{\\boxed{\\text{3}}\\times 3}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nThe products $XY$ and $YZ$ are well defined. The product $YX$ is undefined."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186290370 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100869 :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7fbf7dde-3a5a-5e3a-98c4-330f2d78c1ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450256} {:answer/id #uuid "f4fc9501-54e2-5baa-bf12-feec5fed6f1a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450257}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f4fc9501-54e2-5baa-bf12-feec5fed6f1a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "t