es \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\times }_{✓}{O}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 4}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nThe product $PO$ is well defined. The products $OP$ and $PR$ are undefined."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186562872 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100869 :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7f4356be-29f1-5e2b-830b-308a53df5c34" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562882} {:answer/id #uuid "85c9a81f-67cf-5cc7-90ed-a7b1dbdd973d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562885}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7f4356be-29f1-5e2b-830b-308a53df5c34" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562882} :answer-field/id #uuid "63b06bda-1c4c-596d-b2b7-2455e8bb3e84" :answer-field/key "The product $OP$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562878} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4c2fb6f9-03f7-5731-ba5a-e3e4edd662b9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562868} {:answer/id #uuid "4d370fc6-4fed-5c27-900c-ba8012cedd47" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562869}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4d370fc6-4fed-5c27-900c-ba8012cedd47" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562869} :answer-field/id #uuid "b42c3153-374b-54ee-86c7-d7414ae8c1d5" :answer-field/key "The product $PO$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/i